# --- Personal / AI-agent workspace (not for the public fork) ---
.claude/
/docs/superpowers/
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md

# Sibling clones of upstream projects used as references during development
/termux-api/

# Sensitive build inputs (signed-in service account / Firebase config)
app/google-services.json
# Release artifacts staged for GitHub release uploads — debug-signed APKs are
# regenerated each release; no need to track them in git.
/release-artifacts/

# Release signing keystore — never commit
/rikkahub-release.jks

# Local planning doc — not for the remote
/enhance.md

# Separate companion repo - cloned locally, not part of this repo
/agent-keyboard/

# Generated baseline profiles (baseline profiling dropped in this fork)
/app/src/release/generated/

# Local diagnostics may contain device logs, database snapshots, preferences, or identifiers.
/.codex-diagnostics/

# Temporary screenshots captured while diagnosing local builds.
/tmp-rikkahub-*.png

# Private local reverse-engineering notes, captures, and device-specific checklist.
/reverse-engineering/
/docs/system-assistant-phase1-checklist.md

# Only the Kotlin implementation used by the material3 module is vendored. Other language
# trees from a local Material Color Utilities checkout are not part of this Android build.
material3/material-color-utilities/*
!material3/material-color-utilities/kotlin/
!material3/material-color-utilities/kotlin/**
!material3/material-color-utilities/LICENSE
!material3/material-color-utilities/README.md
